$1; exit}')\" ] || die \"没有已连接的模拟器/设备\"\n```\n\nHmm, wait-for-device blocks forever if none; in CI emulator ready. Use timeout? `timeout 120 adb wait-for-device`. But adb wait-for-device may return even if offline? then check. Keep `timeout 180 adb wait-for-device || die`.\n\nBuild:\n```bash\nstep \"assembleDebug\"\n(cd \"$ANDROID_DIR\" && ./gradlew --no-daemon --stacktrace assembleDebug)\nAPK=$(find \"$ANDROID_DIR\" -type f -path '*/build/outputs/apk/debug/*.apk' | head -n1)\n[ -n \"$APK\" ] || die \"assembleDebug 未产出 debug APK\"\nstep \"安装 $APK\"\nadb install -r \"$APK\" >/dev/null\n```\nadb install output redirect; failure exit nonzero due set -e.\n\nLaunch:\n```bash\nadb logcat -c || true\nadb shell am force-stop \"$APP_ID\" || true\nstep \"启动 $MAIN_COMPONENT\"\nadb shell am start -W -n \"$MAIN_COMPONENT\" | tee \"$RESULT_DIR/am-start.log\"\ngrep -q \"Status: ok\" \"$RESULT_DIR/am-start.log\" || die \"Activity 启动未返回 Status: ok\"\nsleep 3\nPID=$(adb shell pidof \"$APP_ID\" 2>/dev/null | tr -d '\\r' || true)\n[ -n \"$PID\" ] || die \"启动后进程不存在（可能崩溃）：$APP_ID\"\n```\nNote `pidof` output may have multiple pids.\n\nSave logcat:\n```bash\nadb logcat -d > \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-full.log\" || true\nadb logcat -d -b crash > \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-crash.log\" || true\nCRASH=$(grep -nE \"FATAL EXCEPTION|Process: $APP_ID\" \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-crash.log\" \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-full.log\" || true)\n[ -z \"$CRASH\" ] || { echo \"$CRASH\"; die \"logcat 发现崩溃\"; }\n```\nBut full logcat contains \"Process: $APP_ID\" maybe in normal? unlikely. FATAL EXCEPTION enough plus \"AndroidRuntime\". Use `FATAL EXCEPTION|AndroidRuntime.*$APP_ID`. Grep with filename prefixes fine.\n\nLifecycle:\n```bash\nadb logcat -d -s \"$LIFECYCLE_TAG\" > \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-lifecycle.log\" || true\nfor token in oncreate onresume; do\n  grep -qi \"$token\" \"$RESULT_DIR/logcat-lifecycle.log\" || die \"未记录生命周期回调 $token（tag=$LIFECYCLE_TAG；待写手交付后对齐 tag/格式）\"\ndone\n```\n\nInstrumented tests:\n```bash\nif compgen -G \"$ANDROID_DIR/*/src/androidTest\" >/dev/null || compgen -G \"$ANDROID_DIR/app/src/androidTest\" >/dev/null; then\n  step \"connectedDebugAndroidTest（A6/A16）\"\n  (cd \"$ANDROID_DIR\" && ./gradlew --no-daemon connectedDebugAndroidTest)\nelse\n  echo \"提示：androidTest 源集未就绪，跳过仪器测试（草稿见 androidTest/ShellNavigationTest.kt；待写手交付后对齐）\"\nfi\n```\ncompgen -G doesn't match dirs? It matches pathnames, yes directories too. Simpler:\n```bash\nif find \"$ANDROID_DIR\" -type d -path '*/src/androidTest' -print -quit | grep -q .; then\n```\nUse find.\n\nFinally echo pass.\n\nOne issue: `exec > >(tee \"$LOG\") 2>&1` with `set -e` and tee: process substitution fine. But at script exit, output flush. OK.\n\nAlso if ANDROID_DIR overridden for local smoke (not needed). Fine.\n\nHeader must say \"待 CI\" at top. Yes.\n\nNow Kotlin file. Let's write carefully with valid Kotlin.\n\n```kotlin\n/*\n * 用途：android-shell 仪器测试草稿（Espresso + ActivityScenario）：未激活 P1 / 已激活 P2 两页切换\n *       断言页面标识；旋转、后台→前台不崩溃且生命周期回调被记录。\n * 前置环境：写手交付后把本文件放入 app/src/androidTest/kotlin/…，Gradle 已配置 androidx.test\n *           （espresso-core、androidx.test.ext:junit、androidx.test:core/runner）；模拟器 API ≥ 26。\n *           本机不装 JDK/SDK，不运行；CI 用 ubuntu-latest + 模拟器执行。\n * 运行命令：cd android && ./gradlew connectedDebugAndroidTest\n * 覆盖 acceptance：A6、A16；A5 的 Activity 启动无崩溃在 ci-run.sh 覆盖，本测试亦启动 Activity。\n * 待写手交付后对齐：package 行、APP_ID、MAIN_ACTIVITY、PAGE_*、NAV_*、LIFECYCLE_TAG、页面标识暴露方式。\n */\npackage com.osaka.connect // 待写手交付后对齐\n\nimport android.app.Activity\nimport android.content.Intent\nimport android.content.pm.ActivityInfo\nimport androidx.lifecycle.Lifecycle\nimport androidx.test.core.app.ActivityScenario\nimport androidx.test.espresso.Espresso.onView\nimport androidx.test.espresso.action.ViewActions.click\nimport androidx.test.espresso.assertion.ViewAssertions.matches\nimport androidx.test.espresso.matcher.ViewMatchers.isDisplayed\nimport androidx.test.espresso.matcher.ViewMatchers.withContentDescription\nimport androidx.test.ext.junit.runners.AndroidJUnit4\nimport androidx.test.platform.app.InstrumentationRegistry\nimport org.junit.Assert.assertTrue\nimport org.junit.Test\nimport org.junit.runner.RunWith\nimport java.io.FileInputStream\n\n// 待写手交付后对齐：包名/Activity/页面标识取自 design/inventory.md（P1=未激活，P2=已激活）与 android/ 实际实现。\nprivate const val APP_ID = \"com.osaka.connect\" // TODO\nprivate const val MAIN_ACTIVITY = \"$APP_ID.MainActivity\" // TODO\nprivate const val PAGE_P1 = \"P1\" // 未激活页标识\nprivate const val PAGE_P2 = \"P2\" // 已激活页标识\nprivate const val NAV_TO_P1 = \"P1\" // 切到未激活页的控件标识\nprivate const val NAV_TO_P2 = \"P2\" // 切到已激活页的控件标识\nprivate const val LIFECYCLE_TAG = \"OsakaLifecycle\" // 生命周期日志 tag，待对齐\n\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass ShellNavigationTest {\n\n    private fun launch(): ActivityScenario<Activity> {\n        val intent = Intent(Intent.ACTION_MAIN).apply {\n            setClassName(APP_ID, MAIN_ACTIVITY)\n            addFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK)\n        }\n        return ActivityScenario.launch<Activity>(intent)\n    }\n\n    // 页面标识若以 tag/testTag 暴露，只需改这一处。\n    private fun assertPageVisible(id: String) {\n        onView(withContentDescription(id)).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n    }\n\n    private fun clearLogcat() {\n        val pfd = InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().uiAutomation.executeShellCommand(\"logcat -c\")\n        FileInputStream(pfd.fileDescriptor).close()\n    }\n\n    private fun lifecycleLog(): String {\n        val pfd = InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().uiAutomation\n            .executeShellCommand(\"logcat -d -s $LIFECYCLE_TAG\")\n        return FileInputStream(pfd.fileDescriptor).use { it.readBytes().toString(Charsets.UTF_8) }\n    }\n\n    private fun count(log: String, token: String): Int =\n        Regex(Regex.escape(token), RegexOption.IGNORE_CASE).findAll(log).count()\n\n    private fun waitForLog(token: String, atLeast: Int, timeoutMs: Long = 5000) {\n        val deadline = System.currentTimeMillis() + timeoutMs\n        while (System.currentTimeMillis() < deadline) {\n            if (count(lifecycleLog(), token) >= atLeast) return\n            Thread.sleep(100)\n        }\n        val log = lifecycleLog()\n        assertTrue(\"生命周期日志缺少 $token（≥$atLeast）：\\n$log\", count(log, token) >= atLeast)\n    }\n\n    private fun awaitIdle() {\n        InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().waitForIdleSync()\n        Thread.sleep(500) // 等待生命周期日志落盘\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun pageSwitchShowsP1AndP2Identifiers() {\n        val scenario = launch()\n        try {\n            // 启动默认是未激活 P1。\n            assertPageVisible(PAGE_P1)\n            onView(withContentDescription(NAV_TO_P2)).perform(click())\n            awaitIdle()\n            assertPageVisible(PAGE_P2)\n            onView(withContentDescription(NAV_TO_P1)).perform(click())\n            awaitIdle()\n            assertPageVisible(PAGE_P1)\n        } finally {\n            scenario.close()\n        }\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun rotationRecordsLifecycleAndDoesNotCrash() {\n        clearLogcat()\n        val scenario = launch()\n        try {\n            waitForLog(\"onCreate\", 1)\n            scenario.onActivity { it.requestedOrientation = ActivityInfo.SCREEN_ORIENTATION_LANDSCAPE }\n            awaitIdle()\n            scenario.onActivity { it.requestedOrientation = ActivityInfo.SCREEN_ORIENTATION_PORTRAIT }\n            waitForLog(\"onCreate\", 2) // 旋转重建 Activity，onCreate 至少记录两次\n            assertPageVisible(PAGE_P1)\n        } finally {\n            scenario.close()\n        }\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun backgroundThenForegroundRecordsLifecycleAndDoesNotCrash() {\n        clearLogcat()\n        val scenario = launch()\n        try {\n            waitForLog(\"onResume\", 1)\n            scenario.moveToState(Lifecycle.State.CREATED)\n            waitForLog(\"onPause\", 1)\n            scenario.moveToState(Lifecycle.State.RESUMED)\n            waitForLog(\"onResume\", 2)\n            assertPageVisible(PAGE_P1)\n        } finally {\n            scenario.close()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nPotential issue: `scenario.onActivity { it.requestedOrientation = ... }` may throw if activity recreates immediately after first change when second call executes. awaitIdle + sleep 500 likely. Could poll. Accept draft.\n\nAlso `assertPageVisible(PAGE_P1)` after rotation: If app was on P1 before rotation, state restored. Fine. However after rotation, ActivityScenario.onActivity second call may fail with \"Activity not found\" transiently if recreation in progress. wait after orientation change should include polling scenario state. Could use `waitForLog(\"onCreate\", 2)` before second `onActivity`? We set landscape then wait for second onCreate, then set portrait, then wait for third onCreate? That changes expected count. Let's structure:\n\n- initial onCreate =1\n- landscape → onCreate=2 (wait)\n- then set portrait → onCreate=3 (wait)\n- assert page.\n\nBut if system ignores orientation change (fixed portrait), wait fails; good signal. Let's do that: after landscape waitForLog(\"onCreate\", 2), then `scenario.onActivity` set portrait, waitForLog(\"onCreate\", 3). More deterministic. But some devices might not rotate due to emulator settings? This is CI emulator, should. Still draft.\n\nNote: `moveToState(CREATED)` triggers onPause + onStop. log token onPause present. Then RESUMED triggers onStart/onResume. Good.\n\nCounting \"onCreate\" could match \"onCreateView\"? Label redacted logs likely \"onCreate\". Fine.\n\nA16: pages P1/P2 identifiers. Content description assumption noted.\n\nAlso we should include a top-level test for A16 \"displayed text\"? Page identifiers enough.\n\nNow also maybe the file should be a pytest-like \"待测\" behavior when module not delivered? Kotlin draft can't run standalone; ci-run handles. Fine.\n\nCould add README? Not required. Maybe a `README.md` in tests/android/android-shell explaining pending? The script outputs it; task wants only file list. Skip.\n\nSelf-check lang-guard: implement.\n\nLet's write files now. Directory: /home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/android/android-shell/\n\nWrite lang-guard.sh, ci-run.sh, androidTest/ShellNavigationTest.kt (or `androidTest/kotlin/com/osaka/connect/ShellNavigationTest.kt`). The task says \"待写手交付后放入对应 androidTest 源集\" — keeping path under androidTest makes placement clear. Use `androidTest/ShellNavigationTest.kt` flat to keep simple; package line mismatch with directory doesn't matter for Kotlin. But when copied, path should be `app/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/osaka/connect/`. I'll use `androidTest/ShellNavigationTest.kt`. Fine.\n\nNeed chmod +x scripts. Bash tool chmod allowed (not modification of product). Do it.\n\nNow write.","signature":"d7f8a04d-c043-4912-bfef-52173d79e510"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":25728,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29f1ea7a-4662-4327-bf9c-839f1bc0a805","uuid":"151748c5-1456-4e78-a133-0b56b4dc3092","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:03:36.243Z","thinking_duration_ms":55465,"thinking_display":"updates"}
