ounts onCreate occurrence (2) which may appear during recreation before RESUMED; then immediate onActivity call might fail. Add wait until scenario state RESUMED or sleep. Could add `awaitIdle()` after waitForLog before second onActivity. Let's improve:\n```kotlin\nscenario.onActivity { landscape }\nwaitForLog(\"onCreate\",2)\nawaitIdle()\nscenario.onActivity { portrait }\nwaitForLog(\"onCreate\",3)\n```\nawaitIdle waits 500ms — likely enough but not state-guaranteed. ActivityScenario.onActivity will block until activity resumed? Actually onActivity requires activity in resumed state? Documentation: onActivity runs on main thread; \"The activity must be in the resumed state\" maybe it throws if not. Adding awaitIdle is a reasonable draft. Do it.\n\nAlso concern with hardcoded page contentDescription \"P1\"/\"P2\": navigational controls may also use same IDs as pages causing ambiguity (withContentDescription matches multiple views → AmbiguousViewMatcherException). In draft, note alignment. Fine.\n\nA16 also mentions navigation order from design/inventory; test just switches both ways.\n\nNow also check scripts permissions from git status? Not relevant.\n\nPotential issue: ci-run lifecycle check with `adb logcat -d -s \"$LIFECYCLE_TAG\"` — `logcat -s TAG` outputs only matching tag, but if writer's tag includes spaces? fine. Also after `am start -W`, logs may not yet have onResume? sleep 3 before pid check, then logcat. Enough.\n\nPotential issue: `grep -nE \"FATAL EXCEPTION|Process: $APP_ID\"` scans full logcat; \"Process: com.osaka.connect\" appears only on crash. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: `adb install -r \"$APK\" >/dev/null` error output goes to stderr and set -e dies. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `exec > >(tee \"$LOG\") 2>&1` — `tee` process continues; script may exit before tee flush? Usually fine.\n\nNow note: ci-run.sh has \"覆盖 acceptance：A5；A6（生命周期日志冒烟...）\". Good.\n\nDoes ci-run cover A17? no; lang-guard covers A14/A17.\n\nA14 acceptance also says architecture tech stack match; not android-specific. Fine.\n\nNow add awaitIdle.","signature":"74f69ec2-e560-4a09-8703-bf6f80cd9793"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":151,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":49920,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29f1ea7a-4662-4327-bf9c-839f1bc0a805","uuid":"4fbfffd1-c50f-4ac2-882b-3df582202a06","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:04:12.672Z","thinking_duration_ms":6345,"thinking_display":"updates"}
